<p>The <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MI0GLcVuOq0" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">AGV trolley evolution</a> came out of the same conversation — when the cart has to move between lines safely, eventually the cart learns to drive itself.</p>
